        "errorMessage": "The API refused X-Hazem-Token: credential hazem-api must hold HAZEM_API_TOKEN from .env (run n8n-import). Messages stay pending."
      },
      "id": "aa23bd9f-36ec-59fa-9c62-684116fd1134",
